<title>UK: Thorn 9-mth pretax profit rises eight pct.</title>
<headline>Thorn 9-mth pretax profit rises eight pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Dec 1996</p>
<p>			 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		18.7		  vs    17.3</p>
<p> Pretax		    123.0		  vs   113.9</p>
<p> Turnover		1,188.4		  vs 1,131.2</p>
<p>NOTE: The nine-month results for the current year have been compared against pro forma figures for the year to December 31 1995 after which Thorn Plc split from long-term partner EMI, the music giant. The earnings per share has been accordingly adjusted. The pre-tax profit is also pre-exceptionals.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
